@startuml
title UI Primitive Wrapper Boundary
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Web Awesome" {
  component "Button" as WaButton
  component "Card" as WaCard
  component "Badge / Tag" as WaBadge
  component "Callout" as WaCallout
}

package "Bonecutters UI" {
  component "Thin wrappers when repeated" as UiWrappers
}

component "Pages" as Pages
component "Reusable product components" as ProductComponents

WaButton --> UiWrappers
WaCard --> UiWrappers
WaBadge --> UiWrappers
WaCallout --> UiWrappers
UiWrappers --> Pages
UiWrappers --> ProductComponents
WaButton --> Pages : direct use is allowed
WaCard --> Pages : direct use is allowed

note right of UiWrappers
Create wrappers only when a site-level
pattern repeats. Page layout and copy stay
with the page owner.
end note

@enduml
